<template><view v-if="failed&&campaignOrder" class="campaign"><text class="heading">活动与拼团</text><view>活动与拼团信息暂时没读取到。</view><button class="ui-button" @click="load">重试</button></view><view v-else-if="data?.campaign_id" class="campaign"><text class="heading">{{snapshot.name}}</text><template v-if="data.group"><view>{{states[data.group.status]}} · {{data.group.paidPeople}} / {{data.group.required_people}} 人付款</view><view>截止 {{formatDate(data.group.expires_at)}}</view><text class="hint">成团后商家才能交付，超时未成团自动退款。请从订单记录查看退款进度。</text><button class="ui-button" v-if="data.group.status==='open'" @click="go('campaigns',{channel:order.channel})">查看活动与拼团</button></template><text v-if="data.kind==='gift'" class="hint">赠品已列入原订单，实付分摊为0元。</text><view v-if="data.giftReturnRequired" class="warning">退款后不再满足赠送门槛，请联系商家确认寄回赠品。系统不会自动扣取赠品标价。</view><text v-if="data.kind==='combo'" class="hint">套装按原商品分摊金额退款，剩余商品不会重新涨价。</text></view></template>
<script>
import {request,go} from '../services/shop'
import {formatDate} from '../services/display'
export default {props:{order:Object},data(){return{data:null,failed:false,states:{open:'等待成团',success:'拼团成功',failed:'拼团失败'}}},computed:{campaignOrder(){try{return !!JSON.parse(this.order?.rules_json||'{}').campaign}catch{return false}},snapshot(){try{return JSON.parse(this.data?.snapshot_json||'{}')}catch{return{}}}},watch:{order:{immediate:true,handler(){this.load()}}},methods:{go,formatDate,async load(){if(!this.order)return;this.failed=false;try{this.data=await request('/orders/'+this.order.id+'/campaign')}catch{this.data=null;this.failed=true}}}}
</script><style scoped>
@import '../styles/component-base.css';
.campaign{padding:18px;background:var(--shop-surface, #fdfeff);margin:12px;border-radius:12px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.9}.heading{font-weight:bold;font-size:20px}.hint{display:block;color:var(--shop-ink, #28546c);font-size:14px}.warning{background:#fff2df;padding:12px}button{font-size:16px}</style>
